{"sourceUrl":"https://dky.njau.edu.cn/info/1042/4986.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:43.179320+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://dky.njau.edu.cn/info/1042/4986.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>南京农业大学</span></span><span>动物科技学院</span><span><span>源于</span>1917<span>年南京高等师范所设农科，是国内最早设立畜牧兽医高等教育单位之一。</span><span>2005</span><span>年，学科获批畜牧学博士点，是江苏省重点学科和优势学科。</span><span>2019</span><span>年，动物科学专业首批入选国家一流本科专业建设点。学院师资力量雄厚，现有教授</span><span>45</span><span>名、副教授</span><span>41</span><span>名，拥有国家杰青、国家优青、国家</span><span>“</span><span>万人计划</span><span>”</span><span>教学名师等高层次人才</span><span>20</span><span>余人。近五年承担国家重点研发计划、国家自然科学基金重点项目等国家级项目</span><span>100</span><span>余项，在</span><span>Science</span><span>等高水平期刊上发表学术论文一千余篇，授权国家发明专利</span><span>90</span><span>余项，主导及参与制定多项国家、行业标准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院建有动物消化道营养国际联合研究中心等</span>13<span>个国家和部省级研究平台，学院科研设施齐全、科研资源丰富，可支撑研究生开展原创性、前瞻性、应用性科研课题。深耕产教融合，筑牢研究生升学就业高质量发展平台。与温氏集团等</span><span>30</span><span>余家行业龙头上市公司开展深度战略合作，共建</span><span>20</span><span>余个校企联合科研与实践基地，行业企业年均设立专项奖学金</span><span>40</span><span>余万元，激励学子勤学笃行、潜心钻研。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院育人成果丰硕，在百年办学历程中，先后培养了包括任继周、刘守仁院士等在内的一大批优秀毕业生，成为我国畜牧水产行业发展的中坚力量。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院积极践行服务三农使命，组织师生团队深入基层开展技术帮扶，在实践中锻炼学子的家国情怀与专业本领，学院毕业生就业率连续五年稳定在</span>95%<span>以上，大量优秀毕业生进入科研院所、头部企业、事业单位就业。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>百年诚朴守初心，深耕动科启新程。一代代南农动科人传承</span></span><span>“</span><span><span>诚朴勤仁</span></span><span>”</span><span><span>的精神，以实干立学科、以匠心育人才、以担当服务产业。学院雄厚的学科实力、一流的科研平台、优质的师资资源、广阔的发展赛道，将为每一位研究生的成长成才保驾护航。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>为更好发挥</span></span><span>我院</span><span><span>资源优势，为全国动物科学相关专业优秀大学生创造一个了解我院和畜牧学科研究进展的机会，激发青年学生对相关学科领域的学习和研究兴趣，选拔优秀学生继续深造，动物科技学院将于</span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span>7<span>月</span></span><span><span>9-10</span></span><span><span>日举办</span></span><span><span>2026</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>优秀大学生暑期夏令营（云端）。欢迎有意报考我院的优秀应届本科生报名参加。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>一</span></strong><strong><span><span>、活动安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1.<span>报名时间：</span></span><strong><span><span>即日起至</span>202</span></strong><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>7</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>5</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>17:00</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.<span>活动时间：</span></span><strong><span>202</span></strong><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年</span>7<span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>9</span></span></strong><strong><span>-</span></strong><strong><span><span>10</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.<span>活动方式：</span></span><strong><span>线上</span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4.<span>活动内容：将开展学院</span></span><span>及科研</span><span><span>团队介绍、走进实验室、优秀研究生交流等活动，近距离感受和了解我院科学研究和研究生培养的优良传统、坚实基础和丰硕成果。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、招收对象及申请条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span><span>.</span></span> <span><span>拟于</span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年本科毕业的各高校动物科学相关专业本科生；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span><span>.</span></span> <span><span>具有良好的思想品德和政治素养，在校期间未受过任何纪律处分，身心健康；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span><span>.</span></span> <span><span>学习成绩优秀，在校期间总成绩专业排名前</span>30%<span>，在科研训练或各类学科竞赛中有突出成绩者优先（如已在重要学术期刊上发表论文、获得省级以上竞赛奖项）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4</span><span><span>.</span></span> <span><span>英语成绩优秀，六级</span></span><span>≥ </span><span>425<span>分或具有其他同等级别英语水平证明者优先</span></span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span><span>5. </span><span>如有特殊培养潜质的学生，可适当放宽上述条件。</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、报名材料</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>拟报名的同学请于</span></span><strong><span>202</span></strong><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>7</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>5</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>17:00</span></span></strong><span><span>前将</span></span><span><span>附件</span><span>1</span><span>签字（</span></span><span><span>需</span></span><span>签字</span><span><span>盖章后提交</span>PDF<span>格式扫描件</span></span><span>）</span><span><span>发至邮箱：</span>xuting@njau.edu.cn<span>，并扫码填写报名汇总表。邮件标题为：所在学校全称</span><span>-</span><span>本人姓名</span><span>-</span><span>手机号。申请材料须真实有效。</span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://dky.njau.edu.cn/__local/D/06/FB/1C84752BEDB70C1BB186C4024B9_4EEB8DD2_169DD.png\"/></p>\n<p><strong><span>四</span></strong><strong><span><span>、审核录取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>报名材料审核与录取工作预计在</span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>日结束，录取名单及活动安排将在动物科技学院网站上公布并短信或电话通知本人，未入选者不另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>五</span></strong><strong><span><span>、联系方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：徐婷</span></span><span>，何青芬</span></p>\n<p><span><span>电</span>  <span>话：</span>025-84395346</span></p>\n<p><span>E-mail<span>：</span></span><a href=\"mailto:xuting@njau.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>xuting@njau.edu.cn</span></span></a></p>\n<p><span><span>欢迎动物科学、动物医学、生物科学、食品科学等相关专业的优秀学子踊跃报名！</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"59c00447fcf8c250b034bb180d240f00f3534cc6413344316e16cdbeef13d107","textLength":1486,"sourceSha256":"256b723eb7c53a341f88e748dcfcb31af1e896c10f31400954893ff8c2bd6f30","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1：动物科技学院2026年优秀大学生暑期夏令营（云端）申请表.docx","url":"https://dky.njau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1440933693&wbfileid=18115550"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c9614c30040baa70f146","title":"2026年南京农业大学动物科技学院2026年优秀大学生暑期夏令营（云端）的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:43.179320+00:00"}
